<div class="txtlevel"><p>Proiect de testare pentru studentii din grupa 236.</p></div>
 <br/><a name='toc_1'></a>
<h1 class='doclevel'>1.Test Suite : pbir3611_IntT</h1>
<div><p>Teste de integrare pentru ProductService folosind strategia top-down, scenariul V &lt;--- S ---&gt; R.</p>
</div><a name="toc_tc30629"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case P236-54: ProductService_IntT_Step1_UnitWithMocks&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">pbir3611</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Se testeaza ProductService in izolare, folosind mock pentru ProductValidator si Repository&lt;Integer, Product&gt;. Se verifica adaugarea unui produs valid si comportamentul in cazul unui ID deja existent.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><ul>
	<li>ProductService este instantiat cu mock pentru validator si repository.</li>
	<li>Se foloseste metoda addProduct(Product product).</li>
</ul>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<ul>
	<li>pentru produs valid, metoda save este apelata;</li>
	<li>pentru ID existent, se arunca BusinessException si save nu este apelat.</li>
</ul>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Automated</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">Medium</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > name of the autotest class:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.ProductServiceMockitoTest</td></tr>
<tr><td > name of the test method:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.ProductServiceMockitoTest#addProduct_validProduct_callsSave</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">pbir3611_F01:  Adaugare Produs [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br/></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<a name="toc_tc30631"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case P236-55: ProductService_IntT_Step2_IntegrateValidator&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">pbir3611</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Se testeaza integrarea ProductService cu ProductValidator real, pastrand Repository&lt;Integer, Product&gt; ca mock. Se verifica acceptarea unui produs valid si respingerea unui produs invalid.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><ul>
	<li>ProductService foloseste ProductValidator real.</li>
	<li>Repository&lt;Integer, Product&gt; este mock.</li>
</ul>

<ul>
	<li>pentru produs valid, validatorul accepta produsul si repository-ul salveaza;</li>
	<li>pentru produs invalid, se arunca ValidationException si repository-ul nu este apelat pentru save.</li>
</ul>

<p>&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Automated</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">Medium</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > name of the autotest class:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.ProductServiceIntegrationTest</td></tr>
<tr><td > name of the test method:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.ProductServiceIntegrationTest#addProduct_validProduct_callsSave</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">pbir3611_F01:  Adaugare Produs [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br/></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<a name="toc_tc30633"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case P236-56: ProductService_IntT_Step3_IntegrateRepository&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">pbir3611</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Se testeaza integrarea ProductService cu ProductValidator real si cu un repository in-memory. Se verifica adaugarea corecta a unui produs valid si faptul ca repository-ul ramane nemodificat pentru un produs invalid.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><ul>
	<li>ProductService foloseste ProductValidator real.</li>
	<li>Repository-ul este in-memory / fake.</li>
</ul>

<ul>
	<li>produsul valid este stocat corect in repository;</li>
	<li>produsul invalid produce ValidationException si repository-ul ramane gol.</li>
</ul>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Automated</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">Medium</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > name of the autotest class:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.ProductServiceIntegration3Test</td></tr>
<tr><td > name of the test method:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.ProductServiceIntegration3Test#addProduct_validProduct_isStoredInRepository</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">pbir3611_F01:  Adaugare Produs [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
